<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID TO PLACE PLN 1.16 BLN WITH NBP.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID TO PLACE PLN 1.16 BLN WITH NBP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks bid to place 1.16 billion zlotys, in nominal terms, at the National Bank of Poland's three, seven and 14 days reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction against a 1.2 billion zloty offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
